  E'First analytic anyone runs against a new tape at a mid-frequency shop: ''how many up-days in this window?'' If your data has a hidden corruption — duplicated date, mis-aligned column — this 30-second sanity check usually catches it before you build a strategy on top.',
  E'Count the SPY days where the close was above the open.',
